        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "In Termux, you can list all your downloaded files using the following command:  \n\n```sh\nls ~/storage/downloads\n```\n\nIf you haven't set up storage access for Termux, first run:  \n\n```sh\ntermux-setup-storage\n```\n\nThen, try listing the files again. Let me know if you need more help!"
          ]
        },
